Device Monitor shows live readings about your device (processor load, memory,
storage, network, battery, thermal state, uptime), a specification sheet for
your model, and a set of hardware checks (screen, touch, sensors, haptics,
speakers and microphone, keyboard and trackpad on Mac) whose results you judge
yourself. It is a utility for looking at YOUR OWN devices.

3. WHAT THE APP DOES NOT PROMISE
- The App shows only the readings that Apple's public system interfaces make
