  or cycle count, fan speed, or per-app memory, and it does not claim to.
- Values in the specification sheet that no interface exposes (for example
  screen diagonal or nominal chip frequency) come from a table of published
  Apple specifications and may lag behind or contain errors for a given model.
- Charts and estimates (battery discharge rate, time to empty, history over
  24 hours or 7 days) are built from readings taken while the App or its
  widgets were running. They are observations, not measurements of your
  battery's condition, and they are incomplete when the App has not been
  running or no widget is installed.
